<title>JAPAN: ALPINE SKIING-SLALOM FIRST LEG TIMINGS.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-SLALOM FIRST LEG TIMINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SHIGA KOGEN, Japan 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times after</p>
<p>the first leg of an Alpine skiing mens World Cup slalom on</p>
<p>Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Ole Christian Furuseth (Norway)  48.93 seconds</p>
<p>  2. Thomas Stangassinger (Austria)   49.32</p>
<p>  3. Tom Stiansen (Norway)		49.35</p>
<p>  4. Mario Reiter (Austria)	     49.36</p>
<p>  5. Finn-Christian Jagge (Norway)    49.63</p>
<p>  6. Sebastien Amiez (France)	   49.79</p>
<p>  7. Siegfried Voglreiter (Austria)   49.86</p>
<p>  8. Kiminobu Kimura (Japan)	    49.99</p>
<p>  9. Andrej Miklavic (Slovenia)	 50.13</p>
<p> 10. Joel Chenal (France)		 50.46</p>
</text>
